WEBVTT

00:00.350 --> 00:05.180
Save a broken manifest and the running stack stays up. Fix it, save again.

00:05.630 --> 00:07.441
A stack with one service.

00:08.830 --> 00:09.852
Start the stack.

00:10.302 --> 00:11.556
The service is running.

00:13.342 --> 00:15.014
Now save an invalid port.

00:15.464 --> 00:17.925
devhost rejects the reload and says why.

00:19.984 --> 00:21.934
The running stack still answers.

00:24.144 --> 00:25.909
Save a corrected manifest.

00:26.358 --> 00:28.123
This time the reload is applied.

00:29.918 --> 00:32.286
The service shows the new configuration.

00:34.358 --> 00:35.519
Stop the stack.
